OL,3,GNEWSALabour wins Holborn and St Pancras
OL,4,Aby-election, beating Green leader Zack
OL,5,APolanski
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour has won the Holborn and St
OL,8,FPancras by-election for the seat
OL,9,Fvacated by former Prime Minister Keir
OL,10,FStarmer
OL,12,FCamden Council leader Sagal Abdi-Wali
OL,13,Fsecured 45% of the vote with a winning
OL,14,Ftally of 12,292, while Green leader
OL,15,FZack Polanski came in second with 8,928
OL,17,FAbdi-Wali calls it an "extraordinary
OL,18,Fhonour" to represent Holborn and St
OL,19,FPancras
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
