OL,3,GNEWSALabour wins Holborn and St Pancras
OL,4,Aby-election, beating Green leader Zack
OL,5,APolanski
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolanski says "of course" he will carry
OL,8,Fon as leader, adding that the party's
OL,9,Fmovement is "so much bigger" than one
OL,10,Felection
OL,12,FHolborn and St Pancras has been Labour
OL,13,Fsince it was created in 1983, with the
OL,14,Fparty taking at least 40% of the vote
OL,15,Fat every general election
